	<TextRow
		Label="resort_secretary_talk_00_m"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>げんざい　ランク　[Digit:2digits Idx="0" ]
[Name:ResortTitle Idx="2" ]　です▼
つぎの　ランクまで
にんきは　あと　[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]　ひつようです▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-21T07:27:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-09-15T06:11:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>現在　ランク　[Digit:2digits Idx="0" ]
[Name:ResortTitle Idx="2" ]　です▼
次の　ランクまで
人気は　あと　[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]　必要です▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-21T07:27:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-09-15T06:11:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>0：ランク数
1：必要な人気
2：リゾート肩書き</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-14T03:44:30" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T09:03:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#00ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="resort_secretary_talk_01_m"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……ズバリ！
[Name:ResortType ]です▼
[Name:ResortType ]を
[Name:ResortTown Idx="1" ]に　ひらいたら▼
きっと　おきゃくさまが　おしよせる
にんきの　おみせに　なるでしょう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-02-02T04:22:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……ズバリ！
[Name:ResortType ]です▼
[Name:ResortType ]を
[Name:ResortTown Idx="1" ]に　ひらいたら▼
きっと　お客さまが　おしよせる
人気の　お店に　なるでしょう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-02-02T04:22:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>0：店舗種類名
1：街名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-09-15T06:54:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
