	<TextRow
		Label="resort_secretary_talk_09_m"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:ResortTown Idx="3" ]は
げんざい　サービスきかんちゅう　です▽
あと　[Digit:2digits Idx="4" ]にち　おみのがしなく！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-30T09:44:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:ResortTown Idx="3" ]は
現在　サービス期間中　です▽
あと　[Digit:2digits Idx="4" ]日　おみのがしなく！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-30T06:52:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>0：ランク数
1：リゾート肩書き
2：必要な人気
3：街名
4：日数
</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-09-16T08:00:37" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T09:03:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
