	<TextRow
		Label="resort_secretary_talk_00_f"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>げんざい　ランク　[Digit:2digits Idx="0" ]
[Name:ResortTitle Idx="2" ]　です▼
つぎの　ランクまで
にんきは　あと　[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]　ひつようです▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-21T07:28:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-09-15T06:11:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>現在　ランク　[Digit:2digits Idx="0" ]
[Name:ResortTitle Idx="2" ]　です▼
次の　ランクまで
人気は　あと　[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]　必要です▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-21T07:28:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-09-15T06:11:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>0：ランク数
1：必要な人気
2：リゾート肩書き</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-14T03:45:18" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T09:03:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#00ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="resort_secretary_talk_01_f"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……ズバリ！！
[Name:ResortType ]です！▼
[Name:ResortType ]を
[Name:ResortTown Idx="1" ]に　ひらいたら▼
この　おみせを　おめあてに
おきゃくさまが　やってくるでしょう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-02-02T06:00:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……ズバリ！
[Name:ResortType ]です！▼
[Name:ResortType ]を
[Name:ResortTown Idx="1" ]に　ひらいたら▼
この　お店を　お目当てに
お客さまが　やってくるでしょう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-02-02T04:31:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>0：店舗種類名
1：街名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-09-15T07:05:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T09:03:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#00ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="resort_secretary_talk_02_f"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……[Name:ResortType ]！
すばらしい　です！▼
[Name:ResortType ]を
[Name:ResortTown Idx="1" ]に　ひらいたら▼
この　おみせを　おめあてに
おきゃくさまが　やってくるでしょう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-02-02T05:55:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……[Name:ResortType ]！
素晴らしい　です！▼
[Name:ResortType ]を
[Name:ResortTown Idx="1" ]に　ひらいたら▼
きっと　お客さまが　おしよせてくる
人気の　お店に　なるでしょう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-02-02T04:26:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>0：店舗種類名
1：街名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-09-15T07:05:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T09:03:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#00ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="resort_secretary_talk_03_f"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……すばらしい　みらいが
たくさん　みえます▼
この　なかで　ズバリ！
なにが　したいですか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-21T08:03:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……すばらしい　未来が
たくさん　みえます▼
この中で　ズバリ！
何が　したいですか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-21T08:03:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T09:03:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#00ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="resort_secretary_talk_04_f"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>では　ひしょの　やくわりを
こうたい　します▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-02-01T07:03:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>では　秘書の　役割を
交代　します▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-02-01T07:03:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T09:03:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#00ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="resort_secretary_talk_05_f"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>では　おみせを
ならびかえます▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-02-01T07:03:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>では　お店を
