	<TextRow
		Label="resort_service_info_tatukii_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンの　けなみや　はだを
おていれして　なついてもらいます。</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-21T06:35:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの　毛並みや　はだを
お手入れして　なついてもらいます。</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-21T06:35:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ブラッシング
なつき10</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-12-06T13:27:50" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T09:04:56" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff78ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="resort_service_info_tatukii_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンの　けなみや　はだを
あらって　きれいに　することで
かなり　なついてもらいます。</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-21T06:36:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの　毛並みや　はだを
洗って　きれいに　することで
かなり　なついてもらいます。</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-21T06:36:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>シャンプー
なつき20</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-12-06T13:27:55" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T09:05:08" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff78ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="resort_service_info_tatukii_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンの　けなみや　はだを
きれいに　ととのえる　ことで
すごく　なついてもらいます。</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2012-01-21T06:45:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの　毛並みや　はだを
